{"reviewId": "212159898_832wBHT32", "review": {"abstract": "还有一个问题，就是所谓的牛鞭效应，由于上游资源品处于供应链的最末端，其波动性是最大的。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "举个例子\n \n- 超市发现某饮料销量从100瓶涨到120瓶（+20%）。\n​\n- 为了保险，它向批发商订150瓶（多备一点）。\n​\n- 批发商看到订单涨了50瓶（+50%），就向厂家订200瓶。\n​\n- 厂家看到需求“翻倍”，可能就扩大生产线、多采购原料。\n​\n- 结果实际需求并没有那么多，大家手里都压了一堆货。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "10744-10787", "createTime": 1757429162, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "212159898_832wBHT32", "userVid": 212159898, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 212159898, "name": "苏苏", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/aXUpZVUYfjzJ47tOWQtY1MVxUVPZVWDsXI67eLqQtMibZF7T8qGfu40J6ibX6CeibZ7A3nSLGgyIPU/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-500", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 70, "likes": [{"userVid": 286159509, "name": "阿白", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ajNVdqHZLLC580m1aEqkzRcRqwtcicc5SJiadR6XtsQCTiaGsocSJuzOic7KBicgchLE18NgVia5MvXtU3ZzARVZialbQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "阿白", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-2-4-I-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}